# The billboards scene, which F7 in mygame cycles to (see docs/rendering/gpu-scene.md#billboards and #impostors): a
# row of sprites that face the camera, foliage cards that turn about their +y, and a line of towers from 10 m to
# 800 m away, whose impostor the farther ones draw as, under the sun. Positions are raw World_Position values in
# units of 2^-24 m. The editor writes this file; see docs/editor/document-and-scenes.md#scenes.
